WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.932
GCB is tested in a PyBullet manipulation suite of
random workspaces built from eighty-four object geometries.

00:00:08.012 --> 00:00:11.607
Tasks span Drawer, Button-and-Drawer, and Analogy,

00:00:11.687 --> 00:00:16.238
each also run with added video distractors to probe
robustness.

00:00:16.318 --> 00:00:18.590
Results average over five seeds.
